  "title": {
    "rendered": "T\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c T\u1ebft Thi\u1ebfu Nhi 1/6 Tr\u1ecdn G\u00f3i &#8211; Chuy\u00ean Nghi\u1ec7p"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>T\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf thi\u1ebfu nhi 1/6 l\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n di\u1ec5n ra h\u00e0ng n\u0103m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e1c tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ecdc, c\u00f4ng ty, t\u1eadp th\u1ec3\u2026 quan t\u00e2m v\u00e0 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c cho thi\u1ebfu nhi nh\u00e2n d\u1ecbp qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf n\u00e0y. <strong>Angeline</strong> \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c bi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng ty t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u1edbi b\u1ec1 d\u00e0y kinh nghi\u1ec7m nhi\u1ec1u n\u0103m trong c\u00e1c event v\u1ec1 thi\u1ebfu nhi nh\u01b0 <a href=\"https://angeline.vn/dich-vu-trung-thu/\">t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c trung thu</a> cho thi\u1ebfu nhi, t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c noel cho thi\u1ebfu nhi. V\u00e0 do \u0111\u00f3, \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi vi\u1ec7c t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf thi\u1ebfu nhi 1/6 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1ec3 Hoàng Lâm Decor th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, \u00f3c t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u1edbi c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh thi\u1ebfu nhi theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.</p>\n<h2>\u00dd ngh\u0129a \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t c\u1ee7a ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi</h2>\n<p>Qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu nhi 1/6 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c bi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t d\u00e0nh ri\u00eang cho tr\u1ebb em Vi\u1ec7t Nam n\u00f3i ri\u00eang v\u00e0 th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi n\u00f3i chung. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00f4n vinh v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 tr\u1ebb em \u2013 nh\u1eefng m\u1ea7m non c\u1ee7a t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai. Qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu nhi l\u00e0 ng\u00e0y m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9\u00a0l\u00e0 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i cho c\u00e1c gia \u0111\u00ecnh m\u00e0 c\u1ea3 c\u00e1c t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c v\u00e0 doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u0169ng n\u1eafm b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ec3 b\u00e0y t\u1ecf t\u00ecnh y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 quan t\u00e2m \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u1ebb em.</p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4971\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1600\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-1.jpg 2000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-1-500x400.jpg 500w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-1-1000x800.jpg 1000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-1-768x614.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-1-1536x1229.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-1-600x480.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /></p>\n<p>Trong kho\u1ea3ng th\u1eddi gian t\u1eeb \u0111\u1ea7u th\u00e1ng N\u0103m \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ea7u th\u00e1ng S\u00e1u, c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 c\u01a1 quan th\u01b0\u1eddng b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u v\u00e0 l\u1eadp k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch cho c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng m\u1eebng ng\u00e0y n\u00e0y, v\u1edbi m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau\u00a0t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu nhi 1/6 th\u1eadt tuy\u1ec7t v\u1eddi cho c\u00e1c em. \u0110\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n di\u1ec5n ra su\u00f4n s\u1ebb v\u00e0 tr\u00e0n ng\u1eadp ni\u1ec1m vui, vi\u1ec7c chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb s\u1edbm v\u00e0 chu \u0111\u00e1o l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft, \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 ph\u1ed1i h\u1ee3p ch\u1eb7t ch\u1ebd gi\u1eefa nhi\u1ec1u b\u00ean li\u00ean quan.</p>\n<h2>Nh\u1eefng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh t\u1ebft thi\u1ebfu nhi 1-6 t\u1ea1i Angeline</h2>\n<p>T\u1ea1i Hoàng Lâm Decor, Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n, m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1ec3 th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n t\u00ecnh y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 quan t\u00e2m s\u00e2u s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u1ebb b\u00e9 y\u00eau. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1eb7c s\u1eafc vui nh\u1ed9n m\u00e0 Hoàng Lâm Decor t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c nh\u1eb1m mang \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t ng\u00e0y T\u1ebft Thi\u1ebfu Nhi \u0111\u00e1ng nh\u1edb cho c\u00e1c b\u00e9:</p>\n<h3>1. C\u00e1c ti\u1ebft m\u1ee5c bi\u1ec3u di\u1ec5n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt si\u00eau h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn</h3>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4963\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4963\" style=\"width: 2000px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4963 size-full\" title=\"t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c T\u1ebft thi\u1ebfu Nhi 1/6\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi.jpg\" alt=\"t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c T\u1ebft thi\u1ebfu Nhi 1/6\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1600\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi.jpg 2000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-500x400.jpg 500w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-1000x800.jpg 1000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-768x614.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-1536x1229.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-600x480.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4963\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u1ea2o thu\u1eadt l\u00f4i cu\u1ed1n t\u1eeb \u0111o\u00e0n xi\u1ebfc ngh\u1ec7 th\u1eadt trung \u01b0\u01a1ng</figcaption></figure>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4967\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1800\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4.jpg 2560w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4-569x400.jpg 569w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4-1138x800.jpg 1138w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4-768x540.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4-1536x1080.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4-2048x1440.jpg 2048w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4-600x422.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4968\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1800\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-6.jpg 2560w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-6-569x400.jpg 569w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-6-1138x800.jpg 1138w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-6-768x540.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-6-1536x1080.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-6-2048x1440.jpg 2048w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-6-600x422.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4970\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-19.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1800\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-19.jpg 2560w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-19-569x400.jpg 569w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-19-1138x800.jpg 1138w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-19-768x540.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-19-1536x1080.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-19-2048x1440.jpg 2048w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-19-600x422.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /></p>\n<p>Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh bao g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c m\u00e0n tr\u00ecnh di\u1ec5n ngh\u1ec7 thu\u1eadt nh\u01b0 m\u00faa, h\u00e1t, \u1ea3o thu\u1eadt, v\u00e0 xi\u1ebfc, do c\u00e1c ngh\u1ec7 s\u0129 t\u00e0i n\u0103ng th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n, nh\u1eb1m mang \u0111\u1ebfn cho c\u00e1c b\u00e9 nh\u1eefng ti\u1ebft m\u1ee5c th\u00fa v\u1ecb v\u00e0 b\u1ed5 \u00edch.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4961\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4961\" style=\"width: 2000px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4961 size-full\" title=\"t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c T\u1ebft thi\u1ebfu Nhi 1/6\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-7.jpg\" alt=\"t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c T\u1ebft thi\u1ebfu Nhi 1/6\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1600\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-7.jpg 2000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-7-500x400.jpg 500w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-7-1000x800.jpg 1000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-7-768x614.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-7-1536x1229.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-7-600x480.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4961\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh ca m\u00faa nh\u1ea1c \u0111\u1eb7c s\u1eafc cho b\u00e9</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>2. Tr\u00f2 ch\u01a1i vui nh\u1ed9n cho b\u00e9</h3>\n<p>Hoàng Lâm Decor thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf nhi\u1ec1u gian h\u00e0ng v\u1edbi c\u00e1c tr\u00f2 ch\u01a1i gi\u00e1o d\u1ee5c v\u00e0 vui nh\u1ed9n, gi\u00fap c\u00e1c em h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi trong khi ch\u01a1i. C\u00e1c tr\u00f2 ch\u01a1i bao g\u1ed3m t\u00f4 t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, l\u00e0m t\u00f2 he, v\u1ebd tranh, v\u00e0 nhi\u1ec1u ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o kh\u00e1c.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4964\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4964\" style=\"width: 2000px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4964\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-9.jpg\" alt=\"t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c t\u1ebft thi\u1ebfu nhi 1/6\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1600\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-9.jpg 2000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-9-500x400.jpg 500w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-9-1000x800.jpg 1000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-9-768x614.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-9-1536x1229.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-9-600x480.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4964\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1c tr\u00f2 ch\u01a1i vui nh\u1ed9n mang \u0111\u1ebfn ni\u1ec1m vui cho c\u00e1c con</figcaption></figure>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4969\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-22.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1800\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-22.jpg 2560w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-22-569x400.jpg 569w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-22-1138x800.jpg 1138w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-22-768x540.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-22-1536x1080.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-22-2048x1440.jpg 2048w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-22-600x422.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /></p>\n<h3>3. Cung c\u1ea5p nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh</h3>\n<p>\u0110\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh T\u1ebft Thi\u1ebfu Nhi di\u1ec5n ra su\u00f4n s\u1ebb v\u00e0 th\u00fa v\u1ecb, Hoàng Lâm Decor \u0111\u00e3 l\u00ean k\u1ebf ho\u1ea1ch chi ti\u1ebft cho \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1, m\u1ed7i th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tuy\u1ec3n ch\u1ecdn k\u1ef9 c\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u1eebng vai tr\u00f2:</p>\n<p><strong>MC:</strong> Vi\u1ec7c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn MC cho ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh tr\u1ebb em \u0111\u00f2i h\u1ecfi s\u1ef1 c\u00e2n nh\u1eafc k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng v\u1ec1 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng giao ti\u1ebfp v\u00e0 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3 nh\u00ed. MC cho s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n thi\u1ebfu nhi t\u1ea1i Hoàng Lâm Decor kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u1eabn ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh, mang \u0111\u1ebfn ni\u1ec1m vui v\u00e0 k\u00edch th\u00edch s\u1ef1 t\u00f2 m\u00f2, h\u1ee9ng th\u00fa c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c em th\u00f4ng qua c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 tr\u00f2 ch\u01a1i trong su\u1ed1t s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4966\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4966\" style=\"width: 2000px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4966 size-full\" title=\"T\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh 1/6\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10.jpg\" alt=\"T\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh 1/6\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1600\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10.jpg 2000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10-500x400.jpg 500w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10-1000x800.jpg 1000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10-768x614.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10-1536x1229.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10-600x480.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4966\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">MC n\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9ng d\u1eabn ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh l\u00f4i cu\u1ed1n</figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong>Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd s\u00e2n kh\u1ea5u:</strong> \u0110\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb, thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\u00e0 th\u00e1o d\u1ee1 s\u00e2n kh\u1ea5u. \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c tri\u1ec3n khai m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n cho c\u00e1c con.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4965\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4965\" style=\"width: 2000px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4965 size-full\" title=\"T\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c t\u1ebft thi\u1ebfu nhi 1/6\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-3.jpg\" alt=\"T\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c t\u1ebft thi\u1ebfu nhi 1/6\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1600\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-3.jpg 2000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-3-500x400.jpg 500w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-3-1000x800.jpg 1000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-3-768x614.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-3-1536x1229.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-3-600x480.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4965\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0110\u1ed9i ng\u0169 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, t\u1eadn t\u00e2m</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\u0110\u1ed9i ng\u0169 ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh v\u00e0 quay phim<strong>:</strong> Ghi l\u1ea1i to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc \u0111\u00e1ng nh\u1edb c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o m\u1ecdi gia \u0111\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1eb9p c\u1ee7a bu\u1ed5i l\u1ec5.</p>\n<h2>Trang tr\u00ed ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh T\u1ebft Thi\u1ebfu Nhi t\u1ea1i Angeline</h2>\n<p>Hoàng Lâm Decor hi\u1ec3u r\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh T\u1ebft Thi\u1ebfu Nhi \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1ng nh\u1edb b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u t\u1eeb m\u1ed9t kh\u00f4ng gian \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c trang tr\u00ed n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt. Hoàng Lâm Decor cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 trang tr\u00ed tr\u1ecdn g\u00f3i A-Z gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m th\u1eddi gian bao g\u1ed3m \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng, \u00e2m thanh v\u00e0 s\u00e2n kh\u1ea5u, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t b\u1ea7u kh\u00f4ng kh\u00ed l\u1ec5 h\u1ed9i th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 cho c\u00e1c em nh\u1ecf.</p>\n<h3>S\u00e2n kh\u1ea5u</h3>\n<p>S\u00e2n kh\u1ea5u l\u00e0 t\u00e2m \u0111i\u1ec3m c\u1ee7a m\u1ecdi s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n, v\u00e0 t\u1ea1i Hoàng Lâm Decor, m\u1ed7i s\u00e2n kh\u1ea5u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf ri\u00eang bi\u1ec7t theo ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 c\u1ee7a ng\u00e0y h\u1ed9i. T\u1eeb backdrop, b\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1ch b\u1ed1 tr\u00ed n\u01a1i bi\u1ec3u di\u1ec5n, m\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u00ednh to\u00e1n k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o t\u00ednh th\u1ea9m m\u1ef9 v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n cho c\u00e1c em nh\u1ecf.</p>\n<p>\u0110\u1ec3 ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh T\u1ebft Thi\u1ebfu Nhi tr\u1edf n\u00ean g\u1ea7n g\u0169i s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng, Hoàng Lâm Decor trang tr\u00ed theo c\u00e1c concept vui nh\u01b0 ho\u1ea1t h\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o s\u1ef1 ch\u00fa \u00fd cho c\u00e1c em nh\u1ecf.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4973\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4973\" style=\"width: 2000px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4973 size-full\" title=\"t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c T\u1ebft thi\u1ebfu nhi 1/6\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-5.jpg\" alt=\"t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c T\u1ebft thi\u1ebfu nhi 1/6\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1600\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-5.jpg 2000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-5-500x400.jpg 500w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-5-1000x800.jpg 1000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-5-768x614.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-5-1536x1229.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-5-600x480.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4973\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Cung c\u1ea5p l\u1eafp \u0111\u1eb7t d\u1ef1ng s\u00e2n kh\u1ea5u</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>\u00c1nh s\u00e1ng</h3>\n<p>Hoàng Lâm Decor s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng ngh\u1ec7 chi\u1ebfu s\u00e1ng ti\u00ean ti\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ec3 bi\u1ebfn kh\u00f4ng gian s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi c\u1ed5 t\u00edch m\u00e0u s\u1eafc. V\u1edbi s\u1ef1 ph\u1ed1i h\u1ee3p c\u1ee7a \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng LED, laser v\u00e0 c\u00e1c hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t b\u1ea7u kh\u00f4ng kh\u00ed \u1ea5m \u00e1p ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u00e2m l\u00fd v\u00e0 s\u1edf th\u00edch c\u1ee7a tr\u1ebb em.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4974\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4974\" style=\"width: 2000px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4974 size-full\" title=\" t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh 1/6\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4-1.jpg\" alt=\" t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh 1/6\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1600\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4-1.jpg 2000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4-1-500x400.jpg 500w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4-1-1000x800.jpg 1000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4-1-768x614.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4-1-1536x1229.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-4-1-600x480.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4974\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Cung c\u1ea5p \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh 1/6</figcaption></figure>\n<h3>\u00c2m thanh</h3>\n<p>Ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u00e2m thanh r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 s\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 thi\u1ebfu trong m\u1ecdi ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh d\u00e0nh cho thi\u1ebfu nhi. H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng \u00e2m thanh c\u1ee7a Hoàng Lâm Decor \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c trang b\u1ecb nh\u1eefng thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ea1i nh\u1ea5t, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o \u00e2m thanh ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi tr\u1ebb em v\u00e0 ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 t\u1ed1t cho c\u00e1c ti\u1ebft m\u1ee5c bi\u1ec3u di\u1ec5n v\u00e0 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed.</p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4975\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4975\" style=\"width: 2000px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4975 size-full\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-2-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1600\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-2-1.jpg 2000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-2-1-500x400.jpg 500w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-2-1-1000x800.jpg 1000w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-2-1-768x614.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-2-1-1536x1229.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-2-1-600x480.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px\" /><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4975\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Cung c\u1ea5p \u00e2m thanh ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng</figcaption></figure>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tham kh\u1ea3o combo t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh thi\u1ebfu nhi 1/6 t\u1ea1i Angeline</span></h2>\n<p>T\u1ea1i Hoàng Lâm Decor, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i cung c\u1ea5p c\u00e1c combo d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n thi\u1ebfu nhi \u0111a d\u1ea1ng, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng nhu c\u1ea7u v\u00e0 ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch c\u1ee7a t\u1eebng gia \u0111\u00ecnh, tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ecdc hay t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c. D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 combo ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn m\u00e0 b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tham kh\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c m\u1ed9t ng\u00e0y l\u1ec5 \u0111\u00e1ng nh\u1edb cho c\u00e1c b\u00e9:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4957\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"5120\" height=\"3600\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1-1.png 5120w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1-1-569x400.png 569w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1-1-1138x800.png 1138w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1-1-768x540.png 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1-1-1536x1080.png 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1-1-2048x1440.png 2048w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/1-1-600x422.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 5120px) 100vw, 5120px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4958\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/2-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"5120\" height=\"3600\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/2-1.png 5120w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/2-1-569x400.png 569w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/2-1-1138x800.png 1138w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/2-1-768x540.png 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/2-1-1536x1080.png 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/2-1-2048x1440.png 2048w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/2-1-600x422.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 5120px) 100vw, 5120px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4959\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"5120\" height=\"3600\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3-1.png 5120w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3-1-569x400.png 569w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3-1-1138x800.png 1138w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3-1-768x540.png 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3-1-1536x1080.png 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3-1-2048x1440.png 2048w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/3-1-600x422.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 5120px) 100vw, 5120px\" /></p>\n<p>M\u1ed7i combo \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o c\u00e1c b\u00e9 v\u00e0 gia \u0111\u00ecnh c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eadn h\u01b0\u1edfng tr\u1ecdn v\u1eb9n t\u1eebng kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc, mang l\u1ea1i ni\u1ec1m vui v\u00e0 k\u1ef7 ni\u1ec7m kh\u00f3 qu\u00ean.</p>\n<h2>Hoàng Lâm Decor &#8211; \u0110\u01a1n v\u1ecb t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c t\u1ebft thi\u1ebfu nhi 1/6 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng</h2>\n<p>Hoàng Lâm Decor t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o l\u00e0 \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u trong l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh T\u1ebft Thi\u1ebfu Nhi v\u1edbi s\u1ef1 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5. 12 n\u0103m kinh nghi\u1ec7m trong ng\u00e0nh s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n, Hoàng Lâm Decor cam k\u1ebft mang \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng b\u1eefa ti\u1ec7c ng\u00e0y l\u1ec5 \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, vui nh\u1ed9n v\u00e0 an to\u00e0n cho b\u00e9 y\u00eau.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4978\" src=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1800\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10-1.jpg 2560w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10-1-569x400.jpg 569w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10-1-1138x800.jpg 1138w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10-1-768x540.jpg 768w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10-1-1536x1080.jpg 1536w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10-1-2048x1440.jpg 2048w, https://angeline.vn/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/to-chuc-tet-thieu-nhi-1-6-tron-goi-10-1-600x422.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /></p>\n<p>Hoàng Lâm Decor mong mu\u1ed1n r\u1eb1ng \u0111em l\u1ea1i nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb t\u1ed1t \u0111\u1eb9p v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 l\u00ean h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng l\u00e0 con thuy\u1ec1n v\u1eefng ch\u1eafc gi\u00fap AngelineHoàng Lâm Decor \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1eefng tr\u00ean th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u00e0y nay. V\u1edbi sologan &#8220;Mang ni\u1ec1m vui \u0111\u1ebfn Thi\u00ean Th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n&#8221;, ch\u00fang t\u00f4i vinh h\u1ea1nh l\u00e0 \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb mang ni\u1ec1m vui ti\u1ebfng c\u01b0\u1eddi cho c\u00e1c em nh\u1ecf trong d\u1ecbp T\u1ebft thi\u1ebfu nhi 1/6 v\u1edbi c\u00e1c ti\u00eau ch\u00ed:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>K\u1ecbch b\u1ea3n h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi l\u1ee9a tu\u1ed5i</li>\n<li>D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 tr\u1ecdn g\u00f3i: t\u1eeb c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ebfn s\u00e2n kh\u1ea5u, \u00e2m thanh \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng</li>\n<li>\u0110\u1ed9i ng\u0169 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, t\u1eadn t\u00e2m, tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00e0o t\u1ea1p k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u1ea3m an to\u00e0n trong su\u1ed1t qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh c\u1ee7a s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n.</li>\n<li>Chi ph\u00ed h\u1ee3p l\u00fd, t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n nhi\u1ec7t t\u00ecnh ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi nhu c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng</li>\n</ul>\n<p>H\u00e3y li\u00ean h\u1ec7 v\u1edbi Hoàng Lâm Decor \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n v\u00e0 b\u00e1o gi\u00e1 chi ti\u1ebft cho t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh T\u1ebft Thi\u1ebfu Nhi 1/6 s\u1eafp t\u1edbi nh\u00e9!</p>\n\n<div class=\"wpcf7 no-js\" id=\"wpcf7-f1871-o1\" lang=\"vi\" dir=\"ltr\" data-wpcf7-id=\"1871\">\n<div class=\"screen-reader-response\"><p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></p> <ul></ul></div>\n<form action=\"/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/4915#wpcf7-f1871-o1\" method=\"post\" class=\"wpcf7-form init\" aria-label=\"Form li\u00ean h\u1ec7\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" data-status=\"init\">\n<div style=\"display: none;\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"1871\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"6.0.6\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"vi\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f1871-o1\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"0\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_posted_data_hash\" value=\"\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_recaptcha_response\" value=\"\" />\n</div>\n<h2>T\u01af V\u1ea4N D\u1ecaCH V\u1ee4\n</h2>\n<p><span class=\"content_form\">B\u1ea1n vui l\u00f2ng \u0111i\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng tin theo form b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn lo\u1ea1i d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ec3 nh\u1eadn t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n</span><br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"text-187\"><input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-required\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"H\u1ecd v\u00e0 t\u00ean\" value=\"\" type=\"text\" name=\"text-187\" /></span><br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"email-944\"><input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-email wpcf7-validates-as-required wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-email\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Email\" value=\"\" type=\"email\" name=\"email-944\" /></span><br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"tel-433\"><input size=\"40\" maxlength=\"400\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-tel wpcf7-validates-as-required wpcf7-text wpcf7-validates-as-tel\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"S\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i\" value=\"\" type=\"tel\" name=\"tel-433\" /></span><br />\n<span class=\"wpcf7-form-control-wrap\" data-name=\"textarea-63\"><textarea cols=\"40\" rows=\"10\" maxlength=\"2000\" class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-textarea\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"\" name=\"textarea-63\"></textarea></span><br />\n<input class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-submit has-spinner\" type=\"submit\" value=\"\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd\" />\n</p><div class=\"wpcf7-response-output\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</form>\n</div>\n\n<p>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014-</p>\n<p>\